My answers to the above points are as under;
1. In the Negative 2. As per final order.
REASONS 11. Point No.1:- I have gone through the order-sheet.

We sum up our conclusions on this score as follows: (i)
Directions issued in Priyanka Shrivastava (supra) are mandatory;
(ii) Guidelines laid down in Priyanka Shrivastava (supra) operate prospectively; (iii) Nonfiling of the supporting affidavit is a curable defect, but must be cured before the Magistrate passes any substantive order on the complaint/application, and;
(iv) If the Magistrate proceeds without the requisite affidavit, such order/any consequential orders/proceedings can be quashed on the sole ground of non-compliance with Priyanka Shrivastava (supra).
